# The santa head, bursting: the front right piece (3 of 7). Made by tools/make-head-pieces.py (do not edit by hand): the head
# (the santa_head part, so the pieces follow its edits) intersected with the Voronoi cell of one seed; the cells split all of space with
# no gap or overlap, so the pieces together are the head. The cut faces are the head_inner material. Low detail: debris lives seconds.
format 1
collider none
surface part=santa_head

Detail detail=0.5
    Intersection
        Part part=santa_head
        Material material=head_inner
            Intersection
                Plane normal=(0.4969, 0.6776, -0.5421) height=0.0226
                Plane normal=(1.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000) height=-0.0000
                Plane normal=(0.6757, 0.0000, -0.7372) height=-0.0000
                Plane normal=(0.0000, 0.0000, -1.0000) height=-0.0000
                Plane normal=(0.6707, -0.7317, -0.1219) height=-0.0082
                Plane normal=(0.4027, -0.5492, -0.7323) height=-0.0154
